{
  "preset": {
    "name": "case",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "0.1.0",
    "sources": [
      {
        "ns": "core",
        "kind": "builtin",
        "version": "0.1.0"
      },
      {
        "ns": "local",
        "kind": "path",
        "path": ".pregate/rules"
      },
      {
        "ns": "example",
        "kind": "library",
        "version": "0.1.0"
      }
    ],
    "methodologies": [
      "example/clean-code",
      "local/team"
    ],
    "layers": {
      "domain": {
        "paths": [
          "src/domain/**"
        ],
        "mayImport": [],
        "kind": "core"
      }
    },
    "overrides": {
      "TEAM-FN-001": {
        "severity": "warn",
        "params": {
          "max": 3
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "errors": [
    "unresolved conflict in dimension \"fn.params\": example/CC-FN-002 {\"max\":3} deny vs local/TEAM-FN-001 {\"max\":3} warn. Suggestion from local/team: Handlers take a command plus ports. Add to the preset \"resolve\": {\"fn.params\": {\"use\": \"local/team\"}}, or set the value in \"overrides\"."
  ]
}
